        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS and live‑tracking software. Clients receive a secure link to monitor the exact location, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring complete visibility throughout the journey.</p>
