        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the 7‑layer packaging system suitable for moving delicate temple idols and antique furniture?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. The system starts with moisture‑resistant stretch film, followed by heavy‑duty bubble wrap, 5‑ply corrugated cardboard, high‑density foam edge guards, and finishes with custom‑cut wooden crates for items like idols and antiques, providing multi‑point shock absorption and climate protection.</p>
