      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes a mover IBA‑approved and why does it matter for Bilaspur customers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval means the mover adheres to the Indian Banks Association’s code of conduct, including verified licensing, insurance coverage, and transparent billing. For Bilaspur clients, this ensures financial safety, reliable service, and eligibility for bank‑backed relocation loans or guarantees.</p>
