      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I arrange a same‑day vehicle for a small shipment of a few household goods in Bilaspur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our online labour platform lets you book a two‑wheeler carrier or a small enclosed van instantly. After entering the item list, you receive an immediate quote and can confirm the booking. The vehicle arrives within the agreed window, and the crew handles loading with our 7‑layer packing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers for Bilaspur relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves include IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering up to the declared value of each item. The policy protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage during transit, and claims are processed within 48 hours with full documentation support.</p>
